WEBVTT - EduPulse Sample Subtitles

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
Welcome to this masterclass! Today we will explore modern web architecture.

00:04.500 --> 00:09.800
We'll learn how component-driven frontend architecture pairs with Express RESTful backends.

00:09.800 --> 00:15.200
Notice how the custom HTML5 video player provides responsive controls and playback speed.

00:15.200 --> 00:21.000
You can take timestamped notes on the right side and they will automatically sync to your database.

00:21.000 --> 00:27.500
The transcript panel highlights each line in real-time as the audio plays.

00:27.500 --> 00:34.000
Feel free to click any transcript line or saved note to jump the video directly to that moment.

00:34.000 --> 00:41.000
After completing the video lessons, challenge yourself with the interactive quizzes to test your knowledge!

00:41.000 --> 00:50.000
Once you finish all lessons in the course, your official completion certificate will be generated automatically.
